.DS_Store
__pycache__/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/

# Datasets and checkpoints are regenerable from their seeds, and ground_truth.pt is 154 MB,
# past GitHub's file size limit. The two JSON summaries are tracked: poster/poster_final.typ
# reads every number it prints from artifacts/summary.json, so a clone without it cannot
# build the poster.
artifacts/*
!artifacts/summary.json
!artifacts/ground_truth.json

# Working files, kept out of the repository.
slides/
poster/README.md
poster/poster_brief.md
